OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters blocking Garvaghy Road
OL,4,Aahead of Orange Order march
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's First Minister
OL,7,FMichelle O'Neill has joined protesters,
OL,8,Fwhile members of the Orange Order and
OL,9,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,10,Fpoliticians have gathered at Drumcree,
OL,11,Fabout a mile away, waiting for the road
OL,12,Fto clear.
OL,14,FDUP leader Gavin Robinson said O'Neill
OL,15,Fwas breaking the law by protesting.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
